  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Dark Star V1**: back after 42 archived shows (630 days); rare: 12 archived performances [5]\n- **Passenger**: rare: 9 archived performances [5]\n- **Dark Star V2**: back after 40 archived shows (629 days) [5]\n- **News Broadcast**: rare: 7 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **20250329_20250329_0837** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 179 min; rated 2/5 by 2 [1]\n- **deadco2025-03-28**: source not stated; 19 songs; 177 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Crowd 1st Set, Crowd 2nd Set [1]\n- Second set had less talking from nearby audience than the first; taper hoped for better neighbors the next night [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **20250329_20250329_0837**: taped by Hunter S II; transferred by Hunter S II; source: Channels 1 & 2: Audio Technical 853 Cardioids with PIP voltage modification > Roland R07 24 bit 96khz [1]. Also: Transfer chain: SD card to WAV, then Reaper, then 24-bit FLAC; labeled a quick mix [1]\n- **deadco2025-03-28**: taped by Neil Frost; transferred by Frostbyte; source: Shure MV88 ➔ iPhone [2]. Also: Taped with a Shure MV88 on an iPhone 15 Pro Max, recorded as MOTIV video; Converted via QuickTime m4a, split into tracks in Audacity as FLAC, then tagged with xACT [2]",
